    {
      "name": "Wizard",
      "type": "class",
      "img": "icons/magic/symbols/star-rising-purple.webp",
      "system": {
        "description": "<p><strong>In a way, we are magicians. We are alchemists, sorcerers and wizards. We are a very strange bunch. But there is great fun in being a wizard. And great power, too.</strong></p><p><em>—Billy Joel, Berklee College of Music Commencement 1993</em></p><p>Wizards are students of the arcane arts who research and develop spells as academic pursuit.</p><h3>Iconic Wizards</h3><ul><li><strong>Harry Dresden</strong>, <em>The Dresden Files</em></li><li><strong>Merlyn</strong>, <em>Arthurian legend</em></li><li><strong>Sparrowhawk</strong>, <em>Earthsea</em></li><li><strong>Sypha Belnades</strong>, <em>Castlevania</em></li></ul><h3>Playing Wizard</h3><p>The wizard is a squishy blaster focused on Casting Spells. Stay in safety to Cast your Spells and discover Enemy weaknesses.</p><p><strong>Action:</strong> Cast<br /><strong>Move:</strong> Backline<br /><strong>Starting Pack:</strong> Astronomer or Mage<br /><strong>Key Stat:</strong> Reason<br /><strong>Complexity:</strong> ★★★☆☆<br /><strong>Training:</strong> Arcana, Craft, Mysticism</p><h3>Class Features</h3><table class=\"NormalTable\"><tbody><tr><td><p><strong>Level</strong></p></td><td><p><strong>Features</strong></p></td><td><p><strong>Spells</strong></p></td><td><p><strong>Mana</strong></p></td><td><p><strong>Cast Max</strong></p></td></tr><tr><td><p>1st</p></td><td><p>Spellcaster, Page Master</p></td><td><p>4</p></td><td><p>4</p></td><td><p>3</p></td></tr><tr><td><p>2nd</p></td><td><p>Manifold Mind (+1)</p></td><td><p>4</p></td><td><p>8</p></td><td><p>4</p></td></tr><tr><td><p>3rd</p></td><td><p>Perk</p></td><td><p>5</p></td><td><p>12</p></td><td><p>5</p></td></tr><tr><td><p>4th</p></td><td><p>Sculpt Spell (-1)</p></td><td><p>5</p></td><td><p>16</p></td><td><p>6</p></td></tr><tr><td><p>5th</p></td><td><p>Perk</p></td><td><p>6</p></td><td><p>20</p></td><td><p>7</p></td></tr><tr><td><p>6th</p></td><td><p>Manifold Mind (+2), Extracurricular</p></td><td><p>6</p></td><td><p>24</p></td><td><p>8</p></td></tr><tr><td><p>7th</p></td><td><p>Perk</p></td><td><p>7</p></td><td><p>28</p></td><td><p>9</p></td></tr><tr><td><p>8th</p></td><td><p>Sculpt Spell (-2)</p></td><td><p>7</p></td><td><p>32</p></td><td><p>10</p></td></tr><tr><td><p>9th</p></td><td><p>Perk</p></td><td><p>8</p></td><td><p>36</p></td><td><p>11</p></td></tr><tr><td><p>10th</p></td><td><p>Manifold Mind (+3), Archwizard</p></td><td><p>8</p></td><td><p>40</p></td><td><p>12</p></td></tr></tbody></table>",
        "isSpellcaster": true,
        "levelFeatures": [
          {
            "level": 1,
            "name": "Spellcaster",
            "description": "<p>You can Cast Spells using Arcana.</p><p><strong>Spells:</strong> You learn 4 Spells, and 1 other Spell every 2 Levels hereafter.</p><p><strong>Mana:</strong> Your Max Mana is equal to (4 × your Level), and your Cast Max for Spells is equal to (2 + your Level).</p>",
            "statBonusPoints": 0,
            "extraTraining": 0,
            "requiredSpells": [],
            "allowedPerks": [],
            "perkAmount": 0,
            "spellAmount": 0,
            "skillChoices": []
          },
          {
            "level": 1,
            "name": "Page Master",
            "description": "<p>You gain the Bookworm Perk (p. 67), and you can spend a Studied die to learn a Spell for the Shift.</p>",
            "statBonusPoints": 0,
            "extraTraining": 0,
            "requiredSpells": [],
